flowchart TB
    A[Configure, ./configure] --> B[Detect system, features]
    B --> C[Generate Makefiles]
    
    C --> D[Build, make]
    D --> E[Compile sources]
    E --> F[Link binaries]
    
    F --> G[Test, make check]
    G --> H{Tests pass?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Install, make install]
    H -->|No| J[Fix bugs]
    
    I --> K[Copy to system dirs, /usr/local/bin, /usr/local/lib]
    J --> D
    
    style K fill:#c8e6c9
    style J fill:#ffccbc
